     "A variety of complex structures and many error-free sentences, with only a few slips (e.g. 'contacting with relatives').",
     "Some less common vocabulary ('overly complicated', 'multi-purpose apps', 'sacrificing crucial progress') though with the odd collocation inaccuracy ('cuts down the hassle').",
